WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.267
The project asks students to build a small Spark S Q L pipeline.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:09.187
First, inspect the source schema and grain.

00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:12.872
Second, clean and type the needed columns.

00:00:12.872 --> 00:00:18.162
Third, summarize monthly product revenue or readmission intervals.

00:00:18.162 --> 00:00:22.167
Finally, validate output grain and totals.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:29.447
In Spark, validation is still essential because distributed execution can make mistakes expensive.
